  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="33.1a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 33.1a</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="33.1a" corresp="#wit-g-a">And gif hine hwa forene forstande, beon hi begen anes rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="33.1a" corresp="#wit-a">And gif hine hwa fora forstande, beo hig begen anes rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="33.1a" corresp="#wit-q">Si quis eum defendere presumat, sint ambo unius recti digni.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="33.1a" corresp="#wit-b">⁊ gyf híne hwá forstande, beo hig begen anes rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And gif hine hwa forene forstande, beon hi begen anes rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">And if anyone interposes in his defence, they shall both incur the same punishment.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And if anyone intervenes on his behalf, they shall both suffer the same justice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock">And if anyone offers resistance on his account, they are both to share the same penalty.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wenn jemand ihn [gewaltsam] vertheidigt, seien sie beide gleicher Rechtsstrafe theilhaftig.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And if anyone defends him [by force], let them both be subject to the same legal penalty.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="337"><ref target="clause:IAtr_4-2">I Atr 4.2</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">Vgl. I Atr. 4, 2</note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares I Atr 4.2.</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">forene: omitted B; fora A</note>
      </div>
    </body>
